  "contract": "Spell::DoSpellHitOnUnit raised a target's diminishing level only when the caster was player-controlled, so creatures could chain the same crowd control on a player at full duration. Crowd control from a creature now raises the level on a player-controlled target in every diminishing group. Hammer of Justice 10308 (mechanic stun, DurationIndex 27 = 3000 ms) is DIMINISHING_CONTROLLED_STUN (DRTYPE_ALL); Silence 15487 (mechanic silence, DurationIndex 28 = 5000 ms) is DIMINISHING_SILENCE (DRTYPE_PLAYER). Each application within 15 s of the previous one ending halves the duration, and the fourth is resisted as immune. The creature is ten levels above the player so its spells cannot miss.",
